            "review_title": "Review at Nguyen - Experimental Tofu & Arts",
            "review_text": "Misstieka\nBrussels, Belgium27 contributions\n0\nTofu lovers\nDec 2017 • Friends\nA great place in Ho Chi Minh city to taste the traditional Vietnamese tofu-ginger and coconut soup. They prepare it fresh every day. The place is not far from the central station in district 3. The place to be for vegetarian, vegan and other tofu lovers.\nWritten December 23, 2017",
